# Opportunities documentation

## Context source

Before changing Opportunities, Vacancies, Freelance, or Job Post Links behavior, read `docs/opportunities.md` for current models, APIs, admin tabs, applicant pipeline, Apply Now gating, and business rules.

Admin entry: **Admin → Opportunities** (`AdminOpportunitiesSection` with Vacancies / Reported / Freelance tabs). Job Post Links: `AdminJobLinksSection` + public tab on `Vacancies.jsx`.

## Keep the doc updated

After any implementation that touches this feature, update `docs/opportunities.md` in the same change set:

- New/changed API routes or request/response shapes
- Schema field additions/removals on `Vacancy`, `FreelanceOpportunity`, or `JobLink`
- Admin UI flow changes (tabs, applicants panel, status pipeline, job link approve)
- Public browse / apply / Applications stepper / Apply Now gating changes
- Relationship changes with Interview Screening applicant statuses
- New business rules or file paths
- Planned modifications checklist when scoping work

Keep the doc accurate and concise; prefer editing existing sections over appending duplicate notes.

